{"items":[{"str":"made","dir":"ltr","width":24,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,649],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":1,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,168,649],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"Basic Instinct","dir":"ltr","width":61,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,173,649],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":1,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,235,649],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"an antifeminist film. This statement does not,","dir":"ltr","width":216,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,240,649],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"however, provide us with enough contextual information to come to","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,635],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"such a conclusion. One would have to argue that the film suggests","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,621],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"that force was justified, that Nick was right, in other words, to do","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,607],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"what he did. I think one needs to make that case in order to argue that","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,593],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"the film lends consent to the notion of rape.","dir":"ltr","width":197,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,579],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Many people argued the antifeminism or homophobia of","dir":"ltr","width":256,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,565],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,412,565],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"Basic In-","dir":"ltr","width":40,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,416,565],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":true},{"str":"stinct","dir":"ltr","width":23,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,551],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,167,551],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"on the basis of its representation of lesbians as pathologically","dir":"ltr","width":284,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,172,551],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"angry murderers and drug users. But when one analyzes systems of","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,537],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"sexual difference as they are represented in the culture, it is important","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,523],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"not to isolate one side of the term in one’s analysis. In other words,","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,509],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"how is Nick represented in the film? Is he the good guy? Are white","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,495],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"men good in the film? What does it mean that he is represented the","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,481],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"way he is? It is also important to locate the subjectivity of the film, to","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,467],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"figure out whose point of view is privileged and how this shapes our","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,453],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"reactions, responses, and interpretations. Asking questions like these is","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,439],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"a way into a cultural studies analysis of a mass media–produced visual","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,425],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"text. How does the text speak about the social context that produces","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,411],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"it? Does it challenge dominant ideas in the culture? What I am inter-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,397],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ested in here are the possibilities and limits of such texts.","dir":"ltr","width":252,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,383],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"In serial killer films we also witness a certain construction of a sex-","dir":"ltr","width":300,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,369],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ual category—the homosexual—and the traces of its longtime associa-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,355],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"tion with sexual","dir":"ltr","width":70,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,341],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,214,341],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"perversion","dir":"ltr","width":50,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,217,341],"fontName":"g_d2896_f1","hasEOL":false},{"str":". The serial killer is a study in psychopathic","dir":"ltr","width":189,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,267,341],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"perversion: he is usually a man with a sexual dysfunction, and in the","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,327],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"eighties and nineties this has come to be associated predominantly in","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,313],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"public culture with some form of homosexuality. The films men-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,299],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"tioned—","dir":"ltr","width":39,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"Dressed to Kill","dir":"ltr","width":64,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,183,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":",","dir":"ltr","width":3,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,247,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,250,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"The Silence of the Lambs","dir":"ltr","width":106,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,253,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":", and","dir":"ltr","width":23,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,360,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,383,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"Basic Instinct","dir":"ltr","width":60,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,386,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"—","dir":"ltr","width":10,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,446,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"demonstrate a newfound and self-conscious awareness of this identity","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,271],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"category, an awareness based in recent efforts by gays and lesbians to","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,257],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"win recognition and civil rights. It is just such an awareness that makes","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,243],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"these films interesting as symptoms of mainstream culture’s reaction","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,229],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"to post-Stonewall political struggles for visibility, for they uneasily ne-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,215],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"gotiate between “healthy” and “pathological” constructions of gay","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,201],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"identity.","dir":"ltr","width":36,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,187],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,173],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Dressed to Kill","dir":"ltr","width":60,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,173],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,216,173],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"introduces a “new” category of socially recognized per-","dir":"ltr","width":238,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,219,173],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"vert, related in the culture’s mind to homosexuality: the transsexual man.","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,159],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"In the film, the multiple personality of the killer is split between the one","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,145],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,204,677],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Cultural Studies, Popular Culture, and Pedagogy","dir":"ltr","width":191,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,204,677],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,287,117],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"| 25 |","dir":"ltr","width":26,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,287,117],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false}],"styles":{"g_d2896_f2":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.722,"descent":-0.246,"vertical":false},"g_d2896_f3":{"fontFamily":"serif","asce